@baseUrl = http://localhost:5264

### Generate a CAPTCHA challenge (the response sets an HttpOnly client-binding cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/captcha/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

### Validate and consume a CAPTCHA challenge
### Copy challengeId from Generate and provide the answer entered by the user.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/captcha/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "challengeId": "replace-with-generated-challenge-id",
  "answer": "AB234"
}
